            <ArticleTitle>[Comparative evaluation of various methods of draining of intra-abdominal abscesses].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>55-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Results of treatment of 78 patients with intraabdominal abscesses of different localization have shown that treatment with the help of programmed aspiration--irrigation method (in 36 patients) has advantages over other means of drainage of intraabdominal abscesses.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
